    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "394dc214-e2ad-4605-ab3f-2c6b83063ef6",
      "text": "Automatic enrolment questions and answers",
      "udi": "umb://element/e318a2f861c84c61845af5b09f044654"
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "e0876897-88f4-4dcf-ae0a-ec5a37e3a185",
      "text": {
        "markup": "<p>The search results component can be added to any page where you want the user to be able to search the Q&amp;A content accessible on<span> </span><a href=\"https://www.thepensionsregulator.gov.uk/faq-landing-page\" class=\"govuk-link\">The Pensions Regulator website</a>. Currently this is focused on Q&amp;As for Automatic Enrolment. This component should be accompanied with a link, styled as a button, with the CSS class 'tpr-search-results-nav-button' that takes the user to the search results component on the page.</p>\n<p>This component relies on JavaScript to display content. If JavaScript is not available then this component will not display and the accompanying button should link the user to the Q&amp;A landing page. The JavaScript file 'tpr-search.js' is provided as part of the 'ThePensionsRegulator.Frontend' nuget package. This will need to be included in any template that uses this component.</p>\n<p>Three URLs are required to be configured to allow this component to show content. These are configured via appsettings.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>SearchResultsApiEndpoints:PopularContentUrl- This should return a list of content to show when the page loads.</li>\n<li>SearchResultsApiEndpoints:ContentByIdUrl - This should return a singular result and allow the id of the item to be appended to the URL.</li>\n<li>SearchResultsApiEndpoints:SearchContentUrl - This should return a list of keys that can be retrieved by id.</li>\n</ul>",
        "blocks": {
          "contentData": [],
          "settingsData": []
        }
      },
      "udi": "umb://element/dde55b0fb5114956a211166d73b921a8"
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "650d7119-e9cf-4c26-a08c-21cf2ffbbbbc",
      "udi": "umb://element/613aeebaea5e4814aaa097e0c158a49a"
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "94737fb0-c49c-44db-8a59-6a65f14a0c47",
      "link": [
        {
          "target": "_blank",
          "url": "https://thepensionsregulator.gov.uk/faq-landing-page"
        }
      ],
      "text": "Search Q&As",
      "udi": "umb://element/b952f8b8fc384895bbee75399d319441"
    }
